my book, Your One Word.

00:05:22.262 --> 00:05:24.398
I really, really, really
appreciate the support.

00:05:24.398 --> 00:05:25.954
Thank you guys so much for watching.

00:05:25.954 --> 00:05:26.970
I believe in you.

00:05:26.970 --> 00:05:28.944
I hope you continue to
believe in yourself,

00:05:28.944 --> 00:05:30.668
and whatever your one word is,

00:05:30.668 --> 00:05:32.473
and I'll see you again tomorrow morning

00:05:32.473 --> 00:05:35.348
